            "sid": "EPH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siri hiyo hawakujulishwa wanadamu katika vizazi vingine; kama walivyofunuliwa mitume wake watakatifu na manabii zamani hizi katika Roho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.5",
